{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"The general solution of equations of the form $g'(x)=kg(x)$ is\n\n$g(x)=C\\cdot e^{kx}$\n\nfor some constant $C$.\n\nThis can be found using separation of variables. [[☃ explanation 2]]\n\nIn our case, $k=-2$, so $g(x)=C\\cdot e^{-2x}$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{"explanation 2":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"explanation":"$\\begin{align}\n\\dfrac{dg}{dx}\u0026=kg\n\\\\\\\\\n\\dfrac{dg}{g}\u0026=kdx\n\\\\\\\\\n\\displaystyle\\int\\dfrac{dg}{g}\u0026=\\displaystyle\\int kdx\n\\\\\\\\\n\\ln(|g|)\u0026=kx+c\n\\\\\\\\\ne^{\\ln(|g|)}\u0026=e^{kx+c}\n\\\\\\\\\ng\u0026=C\\cdot e^{kx}\\quad\\gray{\\text{Let }C=e^c\\geq 0}\n\\end{align}$","hidePrompt":"Got it, thanks!","showPrompt":"Show me how.","static":false,"widgets":{}},"static":false,"type":"explanation","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}},{"content":"Let's use the fact that $g(0)=5$ to find $C$:\n\n$\\begin{align}\ng(x)\u0026=C\\cdot e^{-2x}\n\\\\\\\\\ng(0)\u0026=C\\cdot e^{-2\\cdot 0}\\quad\\gray{\\text{Plug }x=0}\n\\\\\\\\\n5\u0026=C\\cdot e^{-2\\cdot 0}\\quad\\gray{g(0)=5}\n\\\\\\\\\n5\u0026=C\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, $g(x)=5e^{-2x}$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"$g'(x)=-2g(x)$, and $g(0)=5$.\n\n**Solve the equation.**\n\n[[☃ radio 2]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 2":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$g(x)=5e^{-2x}$","correct":true},{"content":"$g(x)=e^{-2x}$","correct":false},{"content":"$g(x)=e^{-2x}+5$","isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"$g(x)=e^{-2x}+4$","isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"onePerLine":true,"randomize":true},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
